OL,3,GNEWSAInspectors praise surgery's growth
OL,4,Afrom one GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctors' surgery that was once
OL,7,Foperating with just one GP has been
OL,8,Fpraised for its "dedicated staff team".
OL,10,FAlston Medical Practice, located in
OL,11,Frural Cumbria, was left with one GP in
OL,12,F2021 due to recruitment issues, but was
OL,13,Frated outstanding in 2022 when it
OL,14,Fjoined Cumbria Health.
OL,16,FIn an inspection by the Care Quality
OL,17,FCommission (CQC) in April and May, the
OL,18,Fpractice was again rated outstanding
OL,19,Ffor being well-led and caring and good
OL,20,Ffor being safe, responsive and
OL,21,Feffective.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
