OL,3,GNEWSAInspectors praise surgery's growth
OL,4,Afrom one GP
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead of General Practice at Cumbria
OL,7,FHealth, Carrie Martin, said it was a
OL,8,F"fantastic achievement" adding
OL,9,F"providing healthcare in rural areas
OL,10,Fbrings unique challenges", but the team
OL,11,Fwent "above and beyond".
